<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG plans ten-for-one share split.</title>
<headline>HBG plans ten-for-one share split.</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Hollandsche Beton Groep NV said on Tuesday it planned a ten-for-one share split.  </p>
<p>The share split, to be approved at a general shareholders' meeting on May 16, will result in shares with a nominal value of two guilders each, down from the present 20 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
